# Optional. The app normally finds the web server on its own (same machine as
# Expo, port 3000), and you can also type the address on the phone if it can't.
#
# Set this only to pin a specific address - for example a deployed site, or when
# running Expo in tunnel mode where the LAN address can't be guessed.
# Restart with `npx expo start --clear` after changing it.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://your-deployed-app.example.com
